009. F,C,E are collinear [04] & ∠CEB = ∠CAB [09] & ∠BDA = ∠DAB [10] & D,C,A are collinear [01] & ∠DCF = ∠DBF [13] ⇒  ∠BFC = ∠CEB [14]
010. ∠BCF = ∠ECB [06] & ∠BFC = ∠CEB [14] (Similar Triangles)⇒  CF = CE
